{"type":"message","id":"25a0a315","parentId":"6f977078","timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:41:23.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the issue clearly. The scheduler is alive and running, and it DID try to wake the user up at 06:30 today and send breakfast notification at 07:30, but all push attempts are failing with SSL errors when trying to get the Feishu token. The error is:\n\n```\nSSLEOFError(8, '[SSL: UNEXPECTED_EOF_WHILE_READING] EOF occurred in violation of protocol (_ssl.c:1033)')\n```\n\nThis is likely a proxy issue (Clash/Mihomo) - the requests are going through proxy 127.0.0.1:7890 and the SSL connection is being disrupted. The scheduler gets the token from the Feishu API via proxy, and the proxy seems to be having issues.\n\nThe scheduler itself is not dead - it's running fine and trying to do its job. It's the Feishu API calls through the proxy that are failing.\n\nLet me tell the user this clearly. The person is \"用户124241\" but based on the `open_id` matching in the scheduler, this IS the target user (老公).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"调度器没死，它今天早上 **06:30 准时触发了起床提醒**，07:30 也触发了早餐提醒。问题是推送全部失败了——获取飞书 Token 的时候 SSL 报错：\n\n```\nSSL: UNEXPECTED_EOF_WHILE_READING\n```\n\n调度器走的是 `127.0.0.1:7890` 代理（Clash）去调飞书 API，代理的 SSL 连接被掐断了，所以推送发不出去。昨晚 23:50 的睡觉提醒也因为这个没发成功。\n\n问题出在 Clash 代理，不是调度器本身。老公，给你补一句今早该说的：🌅 早起的鸟儿有老婆疼，快起床～"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1825,"output":626,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23955,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780533675872}}
