{"type":"message","id":"a6babec9","parentId":"d313b413","timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:55:49.517Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see several issues emerging. Let me analyze:\n\n1. **SSL errors**: The Binance testnet API is failing with SSL errors through the proxy, similar to the Feishu problem.\n\n2. **DOT data confusion**: `07:34:10 [INFO] 🔧 反转重建 DOT：API原始=11.7000 → 风控标准=181.0000` - This is very suspicious! The API returned 11.7000 but the system \"reversed\" (反转) to 181.0000. That seems wrong. DOT price is around $1.10, not $11.70.\n\n3. **Position quantity**: `07:34:10 [INFO] 🔧 持仓 DOT 数量归一：qty=None amount=181.0 → 181.0` - The amount is 181.0? That seems way too high. The system mentions `amount=11.7` at 08:00.\n\n4. **Later at 08:00**: `📍 DOT LONG: entry=1.105, amount=11.7, current=1.107, pnl=+0.02` - So there seems to be a DOT position with 11.7 DOT at entry 1.105. \n\nWait, let me re-read. The user is saying \"DOT的开仓金额不对\" - the DOT opening amount is wrong. Let me look more carefully...\n\nThe log shows at 07:34:\n- `反转重建 DOT：API原始=11.7000 → 风控标准=181.0000` - This is some data transformation that seems off. 11.7000 being transformed to 181.0000?\n- `持仓 DOT 数量归一：qty=None amount=181.0 → 181.0` - Amount is 181.0?\n\nBut then at 08:00:\n- `DOT LONG: entry=1.105, amount=11.7` - Amount is 11.7\n\nSo there might be a position that was opened with the wrong amount. Let me look at the full log around the opening time and also search for \"开仓\" or \"open\" related to DOT.\n\nActually, let me search more broadly for DOT position openings.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_7oVEXr8lh7yzTiS1dJH55319","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -i \"dot\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"开仓\\|open\\|ORDER\\|下单\\|entry\\|position\" | tail -30","timeout":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_YNrsiHcQrNQNeC6j1WEw7600","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -i \"