{"type":"message","id":"80cd1153","parentId":"28d06800","timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:57:18.323Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_LGZGb6bAGkSRAesuMdPH8268","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \n    # 优先用 Binance API 浮动盈亏（与 query_positions / 飞书问答一致）\n    api_by_symbol = {}\n    try:\n        from binance_auto_trade import get_all_positions\n        for ap in get_all_positions() or []:\n            sym = ap.get(\"symbol\")\n            if sym:\n                api_by_symbol[sym] = ap\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 整点汇报拉 API 持仓失败，用本地计算：{e}\")\n\n    # 构建持仓列表（包含价格、评分、盈亏）\n    pos_lines = []\n    total_floating = 0.0\n    log.info(f\"📋 整点汇报：持仓数={len(positions)}, prices 缓存={len(prices)}\")\n    for pos in positions:\n        normalize_position(pos)\n        symbol = pos['symbol']\n        pos_type = pos['type']\n        entry_price = float(pos.get('entry_price', 0) or 0)\n        amount = position_amount(pos)\n        api_pos = api_by_symbol.get(symbol, {})\n\n        if api_pos:\n            amount = abs(float(api_pos.get(\"amount\", 0) or 0)) or amount\n            if api_pos.get(\"unrealized_pnl\") is not None and amount > 0:\n                unrealized_pnl = float(api_pos[\"unrealized_pnl\"])\n                current_price = float(\n                    api_pos.get(\"current_price\") or api_pos.get(\"mark_price\") or 0\n                ) or prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n            else:\n                current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n                unrealized_pnl = (\n                    (current_price - entry_price) * amount\n                    if pos_type == 'LONG'\n                    else (entry_price - current_price) * amount\n                )\n        else:\n            current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n\n[801 more lines in file. Use offset=1860 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780534638295}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5d101fd","parentId":"80cd1153","timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:57:27.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the critical issue at line 1841-1842:\n\n```python\namount = position_amount(pos)  # local cached amount (correct)\napi_pos = api_by_symbol.get(symbol, {})\nif api_pos:\n    amount = abs(float(api_pos.get(\"amount\", 0) or 0)) or amount  # OVERRIDES with API amount!\n```\n\nThe `amount` is first read from the local cache (which could be the corrected 181.0 from \"反转重建\"), but then it gets OVERRIDDEN by the API position's `amount` field. The API returns the actual position amount (11.7 for the DOT LONG), and this overrides the local corrected value.\n\nSo the \"反转重建\" at line 2346 sets `correct_amount` in the local cache, but the hourly display reads from the API and uses the API's value (11.7) instead.\n\nBut wait - the user said \"开仓金额不对\" not \"显示不对\". Let me think again about what the actual problem is.\n\nThe DOT LONG has 11.7 DOT. Let me check: how did this position get created? It was probably opened manually or by a bug with an incorrect quantity calculation. The system's normal quantity calculation would produce ~182 DOT, not 11.7.\n\nLet me trace back: when was the DOT LONG opened? The logs show it already existed on June 3 at 08:00. Let me check the archive.\n\nActually, let me check what `CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]` and `CONFIG[\"total_capital\"]` are set to.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_E7TOHJDAibtKhWhT5xKH6026","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"position_size_pct\\|total_capital\" /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py 2>/dev/null | head -20","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":548,"output":774,"cacheRead":43136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44458,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"