{"type":"message","id":"c666a01e","parentId":"0c9177cb","timestamp":"2026-06-04T00:57:39.813Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so:\n- `total_capital = 100 USDT`\n- `position_size_pct = 0.20` (20%)\n- `raw_qty = 100 * 0.20 * 10 / entry_price = 200 / entry_price`\n\nFor DOT at ~$1.10: `200 / 1.10 ≈ 181.8 DOT` ✓\n\nThis is correct. The formula is designed correctly.\n\nNow the issue is that the DOT LONG position has 11.7 DOT instead of ~182 DOT. This is clearly because the position was opened with the wrong quantity. Let me check when the DOT LONG was originally opened. It was already there on June 3 at 08:00.\n\nLet me check the archive logs to find when this DOT LONG was opened.\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the log entry more carefully:\n\nAt 07:34:10:\n```\n🔧 反转重建 DOT：API原始=11.7000 → 风控标准=181.0000\n🔧 持仓 DOT 数量归一：qty=None amount=181.0 → 181.0\n📌 DOT 止损 Algo 单已提交：1.0829 algoId=...\n📌 DOT 止盈 Algo 单已提交：1.1492 algoId=...\n```\n\nThen at 08:00:\n```\nDOT LONG: entry=1.105, amount=11.7, current=1.107\n```\n\nSo:\n- The \"反转重建\" corrected the amount to 181.0 and saved locally\n- But the hourly report at 08:00 shows amount=11.7 (from the API)\n\nThe API shows the actual position size is 11.7 DOT. The local cache has 181.0 (corrected).\n\nThis means:\n1. The DOT LONG position on the exchange is indeed only 11.7 DOT\n2. The \"反转重建\" code saves the corrected amount (181.0) locally but doesn't change the actual position on the exchange\n3. The hourly report reads the API position and shows 11.7\n\nThe root problem: The DOT LONG position was opened with the WRONG quantity (11.7 instead of ~182). The \"反转重建\" only fixes the local cache, not the actual exchange position.\n\nBut wait, let me re-check: could the 11.7 DOT LONG be a position that was opened by 老公 manually? Or was it opened by the system?\n\nLet me check the early June 3 morning logs to see if there was any DOT position opened.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"