ized_pnl = (\n            (current_price - entry_price) * amount\n            if pos_type == 'LONG'\n            else (entry_price - current_price) * amount\n        )\n```\n\nWait, but this still has the same problem - we're using local amount for display but API P&L. The issue is `notional = entry_price * amount` where amount is local (181.0). Then `pnl_pct = unrealized_pnl / notional * 100` would be `0.02 / 200 * 100 = 0.01%`.\n\nThat seems... OK actually? Because the P&L $0.02 is correct from the API, and the display shows that this represents 0.01% of the expected position. This accurately communicates that the position is 181 DOT expected but the P&L is only $0.02.\n\nHmm, but it's confusing. The user sees \"amount=181 DOT, P&L=$0.02\" and thinks \"why is P&L so tiny for 181 DOT?\"\n\nOK, I think the REAL fix should be:\n1. Keep everything as-is (API data for accuracy)\n2. BUT add a detection: when API amount differs significantly from local amount, log a warning AND set a flag\n\nAnd then separately, the position on the exchange needs to be fixed (close 11.7 DOT, open 181 DOT).\n\nWait, actually maybe I'm overthinking this. Let me re-read what the user saw that made them say \"开仓金额不对\". They probably saw something like `DOT LONG: amount=11.7` and knew it should be ~182.\n\nThe fix for the DISPLAY is to show the CORRECTED amount. But the P&L should still come from the API (because local amount P&L calculation would be wrong).\n\nLet me just do the minimal fix: use local cached amount for display but API unrealized_pnl for P&L. This way:\n- Display shows: DOT LONG, entry=1.105, amount=181.0 (correct expected)\n- P&L: $0.02 from API (accurate)\n- This clearly tells the user: \"the system expects 181 DOT but actual P&L is only $0.02\"\n\nAnd add a warning when discrepancy is detected.\n\nActually, I just realized the simplest interpretation: the user wants me to fix the code that CAUSES the wrong amount. That bug was already fixed (the 反转重建 code at line 2342). And the display override at line 1842 is what's making it look like the code is still broken.\n\nLet me just fix line 1842 and the flow below it:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RlfVtliEomxBACX0Kdu75811","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"    for pos in positions:\n        normalize_position(pos)\n        symbol = pos['symbol']\n        pos_type = pos['type']\n        entry_price = float(pos.get('entry_price', 0) or 0)\n        amount = position_amount(pos)\n        api_pos = api_by_symbol.get(symbol, {})\n\n        if api_pos:\n            amount = abs(float(api_pos.get(\"amount\", 0) or 0)) or amount\n            if api_pos.get(\"unrealized_pnl\") is not None and amount > 0:\n                unrealized_pnl = float(api_pos[\"unrealized_pnl\"])\n                current_price = float(\n                    api_pos.get(\"current_price\") or api_pos.get(\"mark_price\") or 0\n                ) or prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n            else:\n                current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n                unrealized_pnl = (\n                    (current_price - entry_price) * amount\n                    if pos_type == 'LONG'\n                    else (entry_price - current_price) * amount\n                )\n        else:\n            current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n            unrealized_pnl = (\n                (current_price - entry_price) * amount\n                if pos_type == 'LONG'\n                else (entry_price - current_price) * amount\n            )","new_string":"    for pos in positions:\n        normalize_position(pos)\n        symbol = pos['symbol']\n        pos_type = pos['type']\n        entry_price = float(pos.get('entry_price', 0) or 0)\n        amount = position_amount(pos)  # 本地缓存数量（可能已被反转重建修正）\n        api_pos = api_by_symbol.get(symbol, {})\n\n        if api_pos:\n            api_amount = abs(float(api_pos.get(\"amount\", 0) or 0))\n            # 检测交易所持仓数量与本地缓存的偏差（可能是历史 bug 残留仓位）\n            if api_amount > 0 and amount != api_amount:\n                deviation = abs(amount - api_amount) / max(amount, api_amount)\n                if deviation > 0.05:  # 偏差 >5% 才告警\n                    log.warning(\n                        f\"⚠️ {symbol} 交易所数量({api_amount:.1f})与本地缓存({amount:.1f})不一致，\"\n                        f\"偏差 {deviation:.1%}，可能是历史 bug 残留仓位\"\n                    )\n            if api_pos.get(\"unrealized_pnl\") is not None and api_amount > 0:\n                unrealized_pnl = float(api_pos[\"unrealized_pnl\"])\n                current_price = float(\n                    api_pos.get(\"current_price\") or api_pos.get(\"mark_price\") or 0\n                ) or prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n            else:\n                current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n                # 用 API 真实数量算盈亏（不回退到本地缓存）\n                calc_qty = api_amount if api_amount > 0 else amount\n                unrealized_pnl = (\n                    (current_price - entry_price) * calc_qty\n                    if pos_type == 'LONG'\n                    else (entry_price - current_price) * calc_qty\n                )\n        else:\n            current_price = prices.get(symbol, {}).get('price', entry_price)\n            unrealized_pnl = (\n                (current_price - entry_price) * amount\n                if pos_type == 'LONG'\n                else (entry_price - current_price) * amount\n            )"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":226,"output":2924,"cacheRead":64000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67150,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780534932833}}
