{"type":"message","id":"d077a719","parentId":"98679fc2","timestamp":"2026-06-04T03:48:52.162Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Current positions:\n- DOT SHORT: 181.4 @ 1.08, P&L -0.10\n- LINK SHORT: 4.0 @ 8.23, P&L -0.21\n\nWait, LINK used to be LONG with 21.23 @ 7.93. Now it's SHORT with 4.0 @ 8.23? That seems like a new position. The LINK LONG was closed at TP1 (11:44, +4.01%, +8.01 USDT), and then a new position was opened.\n\nActually 4.0 LINK @ 8.23 = $32.9 notional. That's very small! That should be ~$200 notional. Let me check if this is another wrong-sized position.\n\n4.0 * 8.23 = $32.9 notional, margin = $3.29 at 10x. This is too small again!\n\nBut wait, this might have been opened by the monitor recently. Let me check the monitor log.\n\nActually, let me just present the info the user asked for: market sentiment, BTC, and scores.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"市场全面看空 👑 11 点整所有币种评分 30 分全灭，零信号：\n\n| 币种 | 评分 | RSI | 24h | MA60 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| BTC | 30 | 38 | **-5.1%** | ✗ |\n| ETH | 30 | 29 | -4.8% | ✗ |\n| SOL | 30 | 38 | **-5.8%** | ✗ |\n| BNB | 30 | 32 | **-5.7%** | ✗ |\n| DOT | 30 | 30 | -2.7% | ✗ |\n| LINK | 30 | 32 | -3.3% | ✗ |\n| XRP | 30 | 38 | -3.2% | ✗ |\n\nBTC 现在 ~$63,198，日内跌 5%+。全币种 RSI 集体超卖（29-38），全部在 MA60 下方，典型的单边下跌。\n\n不过跌得猛的好处是——之前两单都止盈了：\n- LINK LONG：+4.01%（+$8.01）\n- DOT LONG：+4.34%（+$8.69）\n\n现在只剩 DOT SHORT 一单（181 DOT @ $1.08），LINK 刚才新开了个 SHORT 只有 4 个 LINK，量又不对了——要我查一下吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":170,"output":807,"cacheRead":80640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81617,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780544919893}}
