{"type":"message","id":"e9306e9c","parentId":"643efd19","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:04:52.068Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No errors in recent monitor log (12:02 restart). And no memory records of code changes. Let me write a changelog to memory so we have a record. Let me also summarize what we fixed today.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"日志干干净净，重启后无报错。\n\n今天修的东西我记一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_gZd5S3BTBlQ3wTZyhIsj4507","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md","content":"# 2026-06-04 日志\n\n## 代码修改\n\n### 1. crypto_signal_monitor.py — 整点汇报不再用 API 量覆盖本地缓存\n- **位置**: 约 1841 行 `push_hourly_report()`\n- **问题**: `amount = api_pos.amount` 直接覆盖本地缓存修正后的数量，显示与实际不符\n- **修复**: 保留本地缓存 amount 显示，盈亏 $ 用 API unrealized_pnl，另加偏差 >5% 告警\n\n### 2. crypto_signal_monitor.py — close_position() 平仓前从 API 取真实数量\n- **位置**: `close_position()` 函数第 1204 行附近\n- **问题**: `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0)` 用本地缓存量，反转重建把缓存改成风控标准量后与实际仓位不一致，导致 reduceOnly 被拒（-2022）→ 降级连锁反应，平仓后留残仓\n- **修复**: `close_position()` 开头调 get_all_positions() 取 API 真实持仓量再平\n- **影响**: 根除 DOT/LINK 残仓 bug（今天 DOT 残 11.7、LINK 残 4.0 均源于此）\n\n## 操作记录\n- 09:05 手动平 DOT LONG 残仓（11.7 DOT @ 1.105）\n- 11:54 手动平 LINK SHORT 残仓（4.0 LINK @ 8.23）\n- 12:02 老公 kj 重启 monitor，改动生效\n\n## 已知问题\n- 评分体系在单边下跌市偏多（RSI<35 给做多分），其他币种评分只有 30 分，开仓阈值 trending≥70 达不到\n- 暂时靠 AI 覆盖补位（DOT/LINK 空单 AI 拉到 100 分开出）\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":163,"output":606,"cacheRead":93696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780545879951}}
