{"type":"message","id":"77190d6a","parentId":"bf14cd03","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:04:56.300Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've recorded the changes. Let me summarize for the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"记好了。今天动了两处 `crypto_signal_monitor.py`：\n\n1. **整点汇报** — 不再用 API 持仓量覆盖本地缓存，避免反转重建修正后又被打回原形\n2. **close_position()** — 平仓前从 API 取真实数量，彻底根除\"本地说 25 交易所只有 21\"导致的残仓连锁反应\n\n已写到 `memory/2026-06-04.md`。重启后目前零报错，有事我会说 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":123,"output":142,"cacheRead":94336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94601,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780545892164}}
