ter → position changes to LONG 11.7 @ 1.02?\n\nWait, the local cache says LONG 196.7 @ 1.017. The exchange says LONG 11.7 @ 1.02.\n\nIf the monitor opened a SHORT at 15:24, but the local cache now shows LONG, that means:\n- The SHORT was closed (probably SL), and then a LONG was opened\n- OR the SHORT failed and the system fell back to open LONG\n\nLet me check more detailed logs around 15:24 and after.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tFS4ztl5UOO8E9sUr38H9157","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -A5 \"15:24:33.*DOT 开仓成功\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | head -15","timeout":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_uwL6tGNXhdEiCkNcWlE49246","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep \"DOT.*平\\|DOT.*close\\|DOT.*反转\\|DOT.*重建\\|反转重建 DOT\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-06-04 15:\\|2026-06-04 16:\\|2026-06-04 17:\\|2026-06-04 18:\" | head -15","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":372,"output":1702,"cacheRead":105728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107802,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780573965850}}
