{"type":"message","id":"a27ce06e","parentId":"e036bee6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:53:43.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the DOT SHORT from after the restart (opened before restart was a different one that was closed at 13:35). After 13:35 the DOT position was cleared. Then at 15:24, a new DOT SHORT was opened with 191.0 quantity.\n\nBut by 17:45, the position had changed to LONG 11.7. How? The close for this NEW DOT SHORT didn't show up in the SL/TP close logs. Let me search for what happened to the 15:24 DOT SHORT. Maybe it was closed by the Algo orders (SL/TP).\n\nLooking at the SL from 17:21-17:24, the stop was being moved down from 1.0679 to 1.0312. The position was opened at 1.047, so the stop started at 1.07 (above entry for SHORT) and moved down toward 1.03.\n\nIf price went above the SL, the Algo order would trigger a market buy to close the SHORT. But the position is now LONG, not empty. So maybe:\n1. SHORT SL triggered → closed 191 DOT SHORT (buy 191 DOT)\n2. But somehow only 11.7 got filled... \n\nNo, that doesn't make sense. Algo orders should fill completely.\n\nWait, maybe after the SHORT was closed by SL, the monitor then opened a LONG and the LONG only got 11.7 filled. Let me search for opens after 15:24.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The DOT position on exchange is 11.7 DOT LONG @ 1.02. The monitor opened a DOT SHORT at 15:24 @ 1.047 with 191.0 quantity. \n\n191.0 / 11.7 ≈ 16.3x difference. That's not a random number - it's suspiciously close to 200/11.7 ≈ 17.\n\nHmm wait, what if the DOT SHORT SL triggered and bought 191 DOT. This closed the SHORT (net zero). Then the monitor opened a LONG. But the LONG only got filled for 11.7 DOT?\n\nLet me look at what happened after the SL close. The SL price was around 1.03, so when DOT went above 1.03, the Algo triggered.\n\nActually, let me look at the monitor log for the exact SL event for the DOT SHORT from 15:24.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_NZAcOPBTCLtHBNr7xZ1e6509","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"DOT\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-06-04 15:2[4-9]\\|2026-06-04 1[6-7]:\" | grep -v \"Algo\\|24hr\\|K线\\|Ticker\\|资金\\|ticker_watcher\\|WebSocket\\|缓存\\|score\\|指标\\|📌\\|持仓同步\\|反转重建\\|💰\\|🤖\\|⏳\\|⏸️\\|冷却\\|跳过\\|已有持仓\" | head -30","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":457,"output":1223,"cacheRead":109440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111120,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574006431}}
