{"type":"message","id":"8ec01381","parentId":"f9a3d09f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:53:49.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see:\n\nAt 16:00: DOT SHORT, entry=1.047, amount=191.0 (from local cache, correct)\nAt 17:00: DOT SHORT, entry=1.047, amount=191.0 (correct)\nAt 17:45: DOT position sync → direction changed from SHORT to LONG, rebuild\n\nSo between 17:00 and 17:45, the DOT SHORT was closed AND a new LONG was opened. But there's no close log! Let me search for any DOT event in that specific time window.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_xAWV4cqVmnfbQLnONjwY0763","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep \"DOT\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-06-04 17:[0-4][0-9]\" | grep -v \"Algo\\|📌\\|24hr\\|K线\\|Ticker\\|资金\\|ticker\\|缓存\\|score\\|每分钟\\|check_positions\\|同步\\|反转\\|持仓\" | head -20","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":667,"output":391,"cacheRead":110592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111650,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574023379}}
