{"type":"message","id":"ed659254","parentId":"d00a0476","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:56:24.780Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_62Cr1KpWpvazWKGRX1n79730","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float, tp_price: float = 0):\n    \"\"\"\n    2026-06-03 修复：精准替换止损/止盈，不碰另一边\n    原逻辑 cancel_all → 止损失败 → 止盈也被删 → 永远缺一边\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        sym_usdt = f\"{symbol}USDT\"\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        \n        # 只取消止损单，不动止盈\n        _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"STOP_MARKET\")\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", new_sl\n        )\n\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已更新：{old_sl:.4f} → {new_sl:.4f}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 更新 Binance 止损单失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 同时更新止盈（如果有变更，只取消止盈不动止损）\n        if tp_price > 0:\n            tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n            _cancel_algo_by_type(sym_usdt, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\")\n            tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n                sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price\n            )\n            if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n                log.info(f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已恢复：{tp_price}\")\n            else:\n                log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 恢复 Binance 止盈单失败：{tp_result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 同步止损/止盈单异常：{e}\")\n\ndef submit_initial_algo_orders(pos: dict):\n    \"\"\"\n    为从 API 同步/方向反转后的持仓提交初始止盈止损 Algo 单。\n    2026-06-03 修复：精准替换，不碰另一边\n    \"\"\"\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n\n[1913 more lines in file. Use offset=773 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780574184753}}
{"type":"message","id":"3b7dbf3e","parentId":"ed659254","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:56:29.890Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the critical issue. Look at `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` - it calls `place_algo_conditional_order` with NO quantity parameter! It only passes:\n- symbol\n- side (SELL/BUY)\n- type (STOP_MARKET)\n- price\n\nThe Algo order is created WITHOUT specifying a quantity. Let me check what `place_algo_conditional_order` does when no quantity is given.\n\nLet me find this function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_jBYonfVBwnr2M5jhRbrQ7703","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"def place_algo_conditional_order\" /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/*.py 2>/dev/null","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":634,"output":289,"cacheRead":115840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116763,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574184822}}
