{"type":"message","id":"da98531d","parentId":"4041fffe","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:56:33.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_DexsSZix0gRtcJufxd0J4385","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","limit":70,"offset":366}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":96,"output":93,"cacheRead":116608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116797,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574190115}}
{"type":"message","id":"3a7cd64c","parentId":"da98531d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:56:33.605Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_DexsSZix0gRtcJufxd0J4385","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def place_algo_conditional_order(\n    symbol: str,\n    side: str,\n    order_type: str,\n    trigger_price,\n    working_type: str = \"MARK_PRICE\",\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    币安 USD-M 条件单（2025-12 起须走 Algo API，否则 -4120）\n\n    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n    side: 平仓方向 — 平多 SELL，平空 BUY\n    \"\"\"\n    params = {\n        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": order_type,\n        \"triggerPrice\": format_price(trigger_price),\n        \"closePosition\": \"true\",\n        \"workingType\": working_type,\n    }\n    return request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", params)\n\n\ndef check_margin_ratio_protection():\n    \"\"\"\n    爆仓保护检查\n    保证金率低于 5% 立即平仓所有持仓\n    \"\"\"\n    margin_ratio = get_margin_ratio()\n    threshold = RISK.get(\"margin_ratio_warning\", 0.05)\n    \n    if margin_ratio < threshold:\n        log.warning(f\"🚨 爆仓保护触发！保证金率={margin_ratio:.4f} < {threshold:.4f}\")\n        close_all_positions()\n        log.critical(\"⚠️ 保证金率过低，已强制平仓所有持仓\")\n        return True\n    return False\n\ndef place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n    \"\"\"\n    下单\n    \n    Args:\n        symbol: 币种符号 (如 BTCUSDT)\n        side: BUY/SELL\n        quantity: 数量\n        leverage: 杠杆倍数 (默认 10x)\n        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n        price: 当前价格（用于计算精度）\n        reduce_only: 是否只减仓（平仓时用，不受最低金额限制）\n    \"\"\"\n    # 2026-03-28 老公指示：开仓前先设置逐仓模式\n    if not reduce_only:\n        set_isolated_margin(symbol)\n    \n    # 格式化数量和价格（根据 Binance 精度要求）\n    formatted_quantity = format_quantity(symbol.replace(\"USDT\", \"\"), quantity, price) if price > 0 else quantity\n    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n    \n    log_order_info(symbol, side, formatted_quantity, price, formatted_tp, formatted_sl, reduce_only)\n    \n    # 1. 设置杠杆（reduce_only 时跳过）\n    if not reduce_only:\n        leverage_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/leverage\", {\n            \"symbol\": symbol,\n            \"leverage\": leverage\n\n[148 more lines in file. Use offset=436 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780574193560}}
{"type":"message","id":"667fbb52","parentId":"3a7cd64c","timestamp":"2026-06-04T11:57:08.370Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"FOUND IT! Look at line 382:\n\n```python\nparams = {\n    \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n    \"symbol\": symbol,\n    \"side\": side,\n    \"type\": order_type,\n    \"triggerPrice\": format_price(trigger_price),\n    \"closePosition\": \"true\",  # <-- THIS IS THE PROBLEM!\n    \"workingType\": working_type,\n}\n```\n\n`\"closePosition\": \"true\"` means the Algo order will CLOSE THE ENTIRE POSITION, not a specific quantity. This is actually the CORRECT behavior - it closes everything at market.\n\nBut wait, if `closePosition=true` closes the entire position, then for DOT SHORT of 191.0, it should buy exactly 191.0 DOT at market. But the trade shows 202.7 bought.\n\nUnless the position on the exchange when the Algo triggered was actually 202.7 DOT SHORT, not 191.0. Let me check if maybe the Algo order update changed the position somehow.\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the trade: BUY 202.7 @ 1.017 at 17:42:39.\n\nThe SL stop was at ~1.03. The entry was 1.047. The current price at 17:00 was 1.042. \n\nAt 17:21-17:24, the SL was being moved down from 1.0679 to 1.0312. At some point the price went above the SL (which for a SHORT is above entry), triggering a BUY.\n\nBut the BUY was for 202.7 DOT, while the SHORT was 191.0. Where did 202.7 come from?\n\nOh wait - maybe the position on the exchange had ALREADY GROWN to something larger than 191.0 before the SL triggered. The position sync at 17:00 showed \"entry=1.047, amount=191.0\" from the local cache. But maybe the exchange had a different amount.\n\nLet me check: did the monitor's Algo update at 17:21-17:24 potentially change the position? When canceling and resubmitting Algo orders, does it affect the position?\n\nNo, canceling Algo orders doesn't affect open positions. Only executed orders do.\n\nHmm, let me think about this differently. The Algo condition order with `closePosition=true` will close whatever position is open when it triggers. If the position was 202.7 DOT SHORT (not 191.0), it would buy 202.7 DOT.\n\nBut why would the position be 202.7? Unless there was another open order that executed before the SL triggered.\n\nActually, wait - what if the TP also triggered? The TP was at 1.005 (well below the current price). No, TP for SHORT is below entry, and price was above entry. So TP couldn't have triggered.\n\nLet me try a different approach: maybe the monitor opened a second DOT SHORT without realizing it already had one. In hedge mode, two SHORT orders would ADD to the position:\n- First SHORT: 191.0 DOT\n- Second SHORT: ~11.7 DOT\n- Total SHORT: 202.7 DOT\n\nThen the Algo with closePosition=true closes everything: 202.7 DOT.\n\nBut I already searched and found no second DOT open. The log only shows one DOT open at 15:24.\n\nLet me check if maybe the algo SL order ITSELF somehow created an extra SHORT. When the monitor updates the Algo order (cancel old, submit new), could the cancel+submit timing cause issues?\n\nActually, I just realized something. Let me re-read the Algo update logs more carefully:\n\n```\n17:21:07 📌 DOT 止损 Algo 单已更新：1.0679 → 1.0342\n17:21:11 📌 DOT 止盈 Algo 单已恢复：1.0051\n```\n\nThe stop was updated from 1.0679 to 1.0342. For a SHORT, the stop is ABOVE the price. If the current price is near 1.03, lowering the stop to 1.0342 could trigger it immediately!\n\nBut the update was \"successful\" (got an algoId). If it immediately triggered, we would see a trade.\n\nLet me just look at ALL DOT trades between 15:24 and 17:42.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_T29gVA1g7f8RU8gWBjpZ7124","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\nresp = request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades', {'symbol': 'DOTUSDT', 'limit': 50})\nfrom datetime import datetime\nif resp and isinstance(resp, list):\n    for t in resp:\n        ts = datetime.fromtimestamp(float(t.get('time',0))/1000).strftime('%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\n        if ts.startswith('06-04 15:') or ts.startswith('06-04 16:') or ts.startswith('06-04 17:'):\n            side = '买' if t.get('side')=='BUY' else '卖'\n            qty = float(t.get('qty',0))\n            price = float(t.get('price',0))\n            print(f'{ts} {side} {qty} @ \\${price:.4f} = \\${qty*price:.1f}  orderId={t.get(\\\"orderId\\\")}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"InsecureRequestWarning\\|warnings.warn\\|已加载\\|API key\\|🔧\\|✅\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":92415,"output":2212,"cacheRead":20480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115107,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574193642}}
