{"type":"message","id":"feef1cbc","parentId":"ee48a5c5","timestamp":"2026-06-04T12:02:44.908Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_9WMtwWDcnkDEfs8C9YDv7853","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-06-04 日志\n\n## 代码修改\n\n### 1. crypto_signal_monitor.py — 整点汇报不再用 API 量覆盖本地缓存\n- **位置**: 约 1841 行 `push_hourly_report()`\n- **问题**: `amount = api_pos.amount` 直接覆盖本地缓存修正后的数量，显示与实际不符\n- **修复**: 保留本地缓存 amount 显示，盈亏 $ 用 API unrealized_pnl，另加偏差 >5% 告警\n\n### 2. crypto_signal_monitor.py — close_position() 平仓前从 API 取真实数量\n- **位置**: `close_position()` 函数第 1204 行附近\n- **问题**: `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0)` 用本地缓存量，反转重建把缓存改成风控标准量后与实际仓位不一致，导致 reduceOnly 被拒（-2022）→ 降级连锁反应，平仓后留残仓\n- **修复**: `close_position()` 开头调 get_all_positions() 取 API 真实持仓量再平\n- **影响**: 根除 DOT/LINK 残仓 bug（今天 DOT 残 11.7、LINK 残 4.0 均源于此）\n\n## 操作记录\n- 09:05 手动平 DOT LONG 残仓（11.7 DOT @ 1.105）\n- 11:54 手动平 LINK SHORT 残仓（4.0 LINK @ 8.23）\n- 12:02 老公 kj 重启 monitor，改动生效\n\n## 已知问题\n- 评分体系在单边下跌市偏多（RSI<35 给做多分），其他币种评分只有 30 分，开仓阈值 trending≥70 达不到\n- 暂时靠 AI 覆盖补位（DOT/LINK 空单 AI 拉到 100 分开出）\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780574564898}}
{"type":"message","id":"c73f451f","parentId":"feef1cbc","timestamp":"2026-06-04T12:03:03.743Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me append the new findings from today's later session. Key findings:\n\n1. **Root cause of DOT 11.7 residues**: `closePosition=true` on Algo stop/take-profit orders is auto-calculating wrong quantities on Binance testnet. For DOT SHORT 191.0, the Algo produced BUY 202.7, leaving 11.7 LONG residue.\n\n2. **Same issue affects LINK**: LINK position on exchange is 21.23 vs expected ~25 (similar closePosition mis-calculation from previous open/close cycles).\n\n3. **Trading results today**: +$43.19 realized P&L on $100 capital (+43%).\n\n4. **Proposed fix**: Modify `place_algo_conditional_order()` to accept and pass explicit `quantity` instead of `closePosition=true`. Modify all callers to provide actual position quantity.\n\nLet me append this to the existing file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_TipMzy1cMiwlje1Fumdh0490","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md","old_string":"## 已知问题\n- 评分体系在单边下跌市偏多（RSI<35 给做多分），其他币种评分只有 30 分，开仓阈值 trending≥70 达不到\n- 暂时靠 AI 覆盖补位（DOT/LINK 空单 AI 拉到 100 分开出）","new_string":"## 今日交易战绩\n\n| 币种 | 方向 | 盈亏 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| BTC TP1 | SHORT @63,103 | +4.12% (+$8.13) |\n| DOT TP1 | SHORT→LONG→平 | +4.34% (+$8.69) |\n| LINK TP1 | SHORT→平 | +4.01% (+$8.01) |\n| DOT SL | SHORT @1.057 | +2.13% (+$4.17) |\n| XRP SL | 空单 | +2.88%/2.20% (+$10.17) |\n| BNB SL | SHORT | +1.60% (+$3.22) |\n| 其他 | TP+SL联动 | +$1.83 |\n| ETH SL | — | -$5.54 |\n| **合计** | | **+$43.19 (+43%)** |\n\n### Algo closePosition=true 根因定位（19:52 发现）\n\n- DOT 空单在币安上为 191.0，但 SL Algo 单（closePosition=true）触发时计算数量为 202.7\n- 多买的 11.7 DOT 形成 LONG 残仓（这是反复出现 11.7 的根因，不是 open_position bug）\n- LINK 同理：开盘后本地缓存 25.23，交易所 21.23，可能经历了一次 Algo 平仓后重新开仓\n- BNB/BTC 数量偏差小（个位数→千位数单价，舍入误差小）\n\n**修法**：`place_algo_conditional_order()` 放弃 `closePosition=true`，改为传入精确 `quantity`，由调用方（open_position / close_position / sync_stop_loss_to_binance）传入当前持仓量\n\n**影响文件**：\n- `binance_auto_trade.py`: `place_algo_conditional_order()` 加 `quantity` 参数\n- `crypto_signal_monitor.py`: `submit_initial_algo_orders()` 和 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()` 传入具体数量\n\n## 已知问题\n- 评分体系在单边下跌市偏多（RSI<35 给做多分），其他币种评分只有 30 分，开仓阈值 trending≥70 达不到\n- 暂时靠 AI 覆盖补位（DOT/LINK 空单 AI 拉到 100 分开出）\n- **待修**：Algo 单 closePosition=true → 精确 quantity（等老公确认）"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":536,"output":1114,"cacheRead":50944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52594,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780574564911}}
{"type":"message","id":"fda4dff2","parentId":"c73f451f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T12:03:03.892Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_TipMzy1cMiwlje1Fumdh0490","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-04.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 17 - 09:05 手动平 DOT LONG 残仓（11.7 DOT @ 1.105）\n 18 - 11:54 手动平 LINK SHORT 残仓（4.0 LINK @ 8.23）\n 19 - 12:02 老公 kj 重启 monitor，改动生效\n 20 \n+21 ## 今日交易战绩\n+22 \n+23 | 币种 | 方向 | 盈亏 |\n+24 |:---|:---|:---|\n+25 | BTC TP1 | SHORT @63,103 | +4.12% (+$8.13) |\n+26 | DOT TP1 | SHORT→LONG→平 | +4.34% (+$8.69) |\n+27 | LINK TP1 | SHORT→平 | +4.01% (+$8.01) |\n+28 | DOT SL | SHORT @1.057 | +2.13% (+$4.17) |\n+29 | XRP SL | 空单 | +2.88%/2.20% (+$10.17) |\n+30 | BNB SL | SHORT | +1.60% (+$3.22) |\n+31 | 其他 | TP+SL联动 | +$1.83 |\n+32 | ETH SL | — | -$5.54 |\n+33 | **合计** | | **+$43.19 (+43%)** |\n+34 \n+35 ### Algo closePosition=true 根因定位（19:52 发现）\n+36 \n+37 - DOT 空单在币安上为 191.0，但 SL Algo 单（closePosition=true）触发时计算数量为 202.7\n+38 - 多买的 11.7 DOT 形成 LONG 残仓（这是反复出现 11.7 的根因，不是 open_position bug）\n+39 - LINK 同理：开盘后本地缓存 25.23，交易所 21.23，可能经历了一次 Algo 平仓后重新开仓\n+40 - BNB/BTC 数量偏差小（个位数→千位数单价，舍入误差小）\n+41 \n+42 **修法**：`place_algo_conditional_order()` 放弃 `closePosition=true`，改为传入精确 `quantity`，由调用方（open_position / close_position / sync_stop_loss_to_binance）传入当前持仓量\n+43 \n+44 **影响文件**：\n+45 - `binance_auto_trade.py`: `place_algo_conditional_order()` 加 `quantity` 参数\n+46 - `crypto_signal_monitor.py`: `submit_initial_algo_orders()` 和 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()` 传入具体数量\n+47 \n 21 ## 已知问题\n 22 - 评分体系在单边下跌市偏多（RSI<35 给做多分），其他币种评分只有 30 分，开仓阈值 trending≥70 达不到\n 23 - 暂时靠 AI 覆盖补位（DOT/LINK 空单 AI 拉到 100 分开出）\n+51 - **待修**：Algo 单 closePosition=true → 精确 quantity（等老公确认）","firstChangedLine":21},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780574583883}}
