{'code': -2022, 'msg': 'ReduceOnly Order is rejected.'}\n2026-06-04 21:18:33 [ERROR] ❌ Binance 拒单：code=-2022 msg=ReduceOnly Order is rejected.\n2026-06-04 21:20:00 [ERROR] 🔴 DOTUSDT 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{'code': -2022, 'msg': 'ReduceOnly Order is rejected.'}\n2026-06-04 21:20:00 [ERROR] ❌ Binance 拒单：code=-2022 msg=ReduceOnly Order is rejected.","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780579943269}}
{"type":"message","id":"ccc387ce","parentId":"0202a84e","timestamp":"2026-06-04T13:32:42.080Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me summarize:\n\nTonight's carnage was a series of SL triggers that cascaded through the positions:\n\n1. **LINK** SL triggered at 21:18 → reduceOnly rejected -2022 → 降级链 → 成功平仓\n2. **DOT** SL triggered at 21:20 → reduceOnly rejected -2022 → 降级链 → 成功平仓 (+$0.27, +2.26%)  \n3. **BNB** opened new SHORT at 21:23 at $591.23 → SL triggered immediately at 21:25 at $620.70 → **亏 -$10.02 (-4.98%)**\n4. **BTC** still alive, SHORT @ 63200.50, SL 64464.51, TP 60672.48\n\nThe BNB loss is the main concern - it opened and hit SL within 2 minutes. That's a painful one.\n\nAlso note: reduceOnly -2022 errors are still happening on testnet! The code changes we made (close_position getting API qty) might not have taken effect properly, or the testnet itself is still broken.\n\nWait actually, looking more carefully, the DOT and LINK SL triggers are from the Algo orders, not from our close_position() code. The Algo triggers result in a MARKET order being placed by Binance automatically. But then our code tries to close the position separately too? Let me think...\n\nThe sequence seems to be:\n1. Algo triggers the SL (position gets closed by Binance)\n2. Our monitor detects the SL trigger\n3. Our monitor tries to call close_position() which tries to place a reduceOnly order\n4. But the position is already closed (or reduced), so -2022\n\nThis is expected behavior when the Algo order fills but our local state hasn't caught up yet. The downgrade chain handles this correctly.\n\nThe real issue for the user: BNB opened and instantly hit SL, losing $10.02. That's what \"怎么回事\" is probably about - why did BNB go the wrong way so hard?\n\nLet me check what happened with BNB price around 21:23-21:25.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在清楚了。今晚来了波连环止损：\n\n**21:18** LINK 止损 → 平了  \n**21:20** DOT 止损 → 平了（+$0.27）  \n**21:23** 系统自动开了 **BNB 空单** @ $591.23  \n**21:25** BNB 反弹到 $620.70 → 止损触发 → **亏 -$10.02（-4.98%）**\n\nBTC 还活着（SHORT @ 63200，TP 60672/SL 64464）。\n\nBNB 那个最伤——开仓后两分钟就被反拉打止损，从 591 拉到 620，瞬间 5 个点没了。这个开仓时机太差了，刚开就被锤，大概率是信号在临界点（60 分）刚好触发阈值，但市场下一秒就反转。\n\n你今天白天赚的 +$43，这一波 BNB 扣掉 $10，DOT 加回 $0.27，LINK 看之前有 $8 盈利，净利应该还在 $40 左右。不算崩，就是 BNB 这一单打得难看 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":698,"output":1178,"cacheRead":36608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38484,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780579943293}}
